              <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg> 弹簧更换</li>
